				       - `package-lock.json` present + no pnpm-workspace.yaml →
				         use npm (`npm ci && npm test`; add `npm run lint`
				         and `npm run typecheck` if those scripts exist)
				       - `bun.lockb` present → use bun
				         (`bun install --frozen-lockfile && bun test`)
				     If CI fails: fix the failure (it counts as another
				     finding). Repeat. If still failing after 2 attempts:
				     stop, post needs-human-input.
				  7. Push to PR branch.
				  8. Post ONE summary comment via gh:
				       gh api -X POST "repos/$REPO/issues/$PR_NUMBER/comments" -f body="$BODY"
				     Body MUST start with these 2 lines:
				       <!-- ai-agent -->
				       <!-- ai-lead-dev-summary -->
